  <language>en_US</language>
  <keyword>bvpinit</keyword>
  <short_description>Create an initial BVP solution guess.</short_description>
  <syntax>
    <syntax_item>solinit = bvpinit(xinit, yinit)</syntax_item>
    <syntax_item>solinit = bvpinit(xinit, yinit, parameters)</syntax_item>
  </syntax>
  <description>
    <p>
      <b>bvpinit</b> creates the initial mesh, state guess, and optional unknown parameters used by BVP solvers.</p>
    <table style="width:100%">
  <tr><th>Input</th><th>Accepted form</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
  <tr><td><b>xinit</b></td><td>Increasing mesh vector.</td><td>Defines the first BVP mesh.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>yinit</b></td><td>Constant vector, array on the mesh, or function handle.</td><td>Defines the initial solution guess.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>parameters</b></td><td>Optional vector.</td><td>Initial guess for unknown parameters.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>solinit</b></td><td>Structure.</td><td>Input for <b>bvp4c</b> and <b>bvp5c</b>.</td></tr>
</table>
  </description>
